          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo mu muryango wa Reyubeni n’uwa Gadi hamwe n’ab’igice c’umuryango wa Manase bishura abakuru b’imiryango y’Abisirayeli bati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", Imana Ihambaye, ni we Mana wenyene! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", Imana Ihambaye, ni we Mana wenyene! Ni yo izi ukuri, kandi n’Abisirayeli na bo nibakumenye. Iki gicaniro ntitwacubatse mu kugarariza ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". Nimba twacubatse mu bugarariji n’ukutumvira, Imana ntitureke ngo tubeho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimba twubatse igicaniro cacu kugira ngo tuve k’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", ngo tugishikanireko ibimazi vyo guturirwa, hamwe n’amashikanwa y’ifu canke amashikanwa y’ishimwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " arabiduharurako.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
