          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni co catumye twibwira tuti: ‘Reka twubake igicaniro, ariko ntitugitangireko ibimazi.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twashaka ko kiba icibutso gusa. Kizokwibutse uruvyaro rwanyu n’urwacu ko natwe dufise uburenganzira bwo gusenga ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " mu rusengero rwiwe, tugashikana amashikanwa yo guturirwa, ibimazi n’amashikanwa y’ishimwe. Ni ho uruvyaro rwanyu rutazobwira urwacu ruti: ‘Nta mugabane mufise k’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
